---
description: prisma migration conventions
globs:
  - "prisma/**/*.prisma"
  - "prisma/migrations/**/*.sql"
  - "prisma.config.ts"
alwaysApply: false
---

# Prisma migration conventions

- Keep `prisma/schema.prisma` aligned with `prisma/migrations/*/migration.sql`.
- Update `prisma.config.ts` when `DIRECT_URL` changes.
- Re-run `npx prisma generate` after schema edits.
- Prefer additive migrations that match existing table names and relations.